(cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ccc}\">\\(\\mathrm{ccc}\\)</span> (countable-chain-condition predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CC}_{\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{CC}_{\\kappa}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-chain-condition predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{CC}_{\\kappa}(\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\bigl(|A|=\\kappa\\to\\exists p,q\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(p\\neq q\\land r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{CC}_{\\kappa}(\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\bigl(|A|=\\kappa\\to\\exists p,q\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(p\\neq q\\land r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}countable\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ccc}(\\mathbb{P}) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{CC}_{\\aleph_1}(\\mathbb{P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}countable\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ccc}(\\mathbb{P}) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{CC}_{\\aleph_1}(\\mathbb{P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>c.c.c.: every antichain is countable</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-c.c.: no antichain of size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li>c.c.c. means that no antichain has cardinality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-centered: union of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> many centered sets</li>\n<li>Proper: preserves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-sequences</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory, Chapter 14 (Forcing)</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-partial-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$